{"schemaVersion":1,"cards":{"ST20-01":{"name":"滚球兽","effect":"","inherited":"【双方的回合】拥有“大冒险”特征的此数码宝贝DP+1000。","security":"","image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1743643745796ST20-01.png","officialId":6467,"form":"幼年期","types":"小型/大冒险","originalModel":"ST20-01","cnProductCode":"ST-20","variants":[{"model":"ST20-01","productCode":"ST-20","officialId":6467,"image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1743643745796ST20-01.png"},{"model":"ST20-01_WT","productCode":"宣传卡","officialId":6686,"image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1744682593452ST20-01_WT.png"},{"model":"ST20-01_CS2026S1","productCode":"宣传卡","officialId":8392,"image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1777023560110ST20-01_CS2026S1.png"}]},"ST20-02":{"name":"比丘兽","effect":"〔进化〕拥有“大冒险”特征的Lv.2：费用0\n\n【登场时】翻开我方卡组最上方的3张卡牌。将其中1张拥有“大冒险”特征的数码宝贝卡牌和1张拥有“大冒险”特征的驯兽师卡牌/选项卡牌加入手牌。剩余的卡牌放回到卡组最下方。","inherited":"【我方的回合】此数码宝贝的DP+2000。","security":"","image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1743643745796ST20-02.png","officialId":6468,"form":"成长期","attribute":"疫苗种","types":"雏鸟型/大冒险","originalModel":"ST20-02","cnProductCode":"ST-20","variants":[{"model":"ST20-02","productCode":"ST-20","officialId":6468,"image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1743643745796ST20-02.png"},{"model":"ST20-02_WT","productCode":"宣传卡","officialId":6687,"image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1744682593459ST20-02_WT.png"}]},"ST20-03":{"name":"巴多拉兽","effect":"〔进化〕拥有“大冒险”特征的Lv.3：费用2\n\n【登场时】【进化时】若我方拥有“大冒险”特征的驯兽师的颜色合计为3种或更多，则可以不支付费用将此数码宝贝进化成手牌中拥有“大冒险”特征的数码宝贝卡牌。\n※此卡属于名称中包含“龙兽”的数码宝贝","inherited":"【我方的回合】此数码宝贝的DP+2000。","security":"","image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1743643745796ST20-03.png","officialId":6469,"form":"成熟期","attribute":"疫苗种","types":"巨鸟型/大冒险","originalModel":"ST20-03","cnProductCode":"ST-20","variants":[{"model":"ST20-03","productCode":"ST-20","officialId":6469,"image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1743643745796ST20-03.png"},{"model":"ST20-03_WT","productCode":"宣传卡","officialId":6688,"image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1744682593462ST20-03_WT.png"}]},"ST20-04":{"name":"伽楼达兽","effect":"〔进化〕拥有“大冒险”特征的Lv.4：费用3\n\n【登场时】【进化时】直到回合结束为止，我方的1只数码宝贝获得《安防攻击+1》（此数码宝贝判定的张数+1）效果，且我方的驯兽师每有2种颜色，DP+2000。\n\n【我方的回合】[每回合1次]当我方的其它数码宝贝登场/进化时，若该数码宝贝拥有“大冒险”特征，则直到回合结束为止，我方的1只数码宝贝获得《联协》效果。此后，可以用我方的1只数码宝贝进行攻击。","inherited":"《联协》（当此数码宝贝进行攻击时，可将我方的另1只数码宝贝转换为休息状态，直到攻击结束为止，此数码宝贝增加被转换为休息状态的数码宝贝的DP，并获得《安防攻击+1》效果）","security":"","image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1743643745796ST20-04.png","officialId":6470,"form":"完全体","attribute":"疫苗种","types":"鸟人型/大冒险","originalModel":"ST20-04","cnProductCode":"ST-20","variants":[{"model":"ST20-04","productCode":"ST-20","officialId":6470,"image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1743643745796ST20-04.png"},{"model":"ST20-04_WT","productCode":"宣传卡","officialId":6689,"image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1744682593465ST20-04_WT.png"}]},"ST20-05":{"name":"迪路兽","effect":"〔进化〕拥有“大冒险”特征的Lv.3：费用2\n\n【安防】当战斗结束时，不支付费用登场此卡牌。\n\n【登场时】【进化时】直到对方的回合结束为止，给与对方的2只数码宝贝《安防攻击-1》（此数码宝贝判定的张数-1）效果。","inherited":"【攻击时】[每回合1次]直到回合结束为止，对方1只数码宝贝的DP-2000。","security":"","image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1743643745797ST20-05.png","officialId":6471,"form":"成熟期","attribute":"疫苗种","types":"圣兽型/大冒险","originalModel":"ST20-05","cnProductCode":"ST-20","variants":[{"model":"ST20-05","productCode":"ST-20","officialId":6471,"image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1743643745797ST20-05.png"},{"model":"ST20-05_XSJST","productCode":"西游主题教学卡组","officialId":8830,"image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1782439842848ST20-05_XSJST.png"},{"model":"ST20-05_WT","productCode":"宣传卡","officialId":6690,"image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1744682593465ST20-05_WT.png"}]},"ST20-06":{"name":"天女兽","effect":"〔进化〕拥有“大冒险”特征的Lv.4：费用3\n\n【登场时】【进化时】可以不支付费用将我方另1只数码宝贝进化成手牌中拥有“大冒险”特征的数码宝贝卡牌。\n\n【我方的回合】[每回合1次]当我方的其它数码宝贝登场/进化时，若该数码宝贝拥有“大冒险”特征，则直到回合结束为止，我方的1只数码宝贝获得《联协》效果。此后，可以用我方的1只数码宝贝进行攻击。","inherited":"《联协》（当此数码宝贝进行攻击时，可将我方的另1只数码宝贝转换为休息状态，直到攻击结束为止，此数码宝贝增加被转换为休息状态的数码宝贝的DP，并获得《安防攻击+1》效果）","security":"","image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1743643745797ST20-06.png","officialId":6472,"form":"完全体","attribute":"疫苗种","types":"大天使型/大冒险","originalModel":"ST20-06","cnProductCode":"ST-20","variants":[{"model":"ST20-06","productCode":"ST-20","officialId":6472,"image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1743643745797ST20-06.png"},{"model":"ST20-06_WT","productCode":"宣传卡","officialId":6691,"image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1744682593466ST20-06_WT.png"}]},"ST20-07":{"name":"甲虫兽","effect":"〔进化〕拥有“大冒险”特征的Lv.2：费用0\n【对方的回合】对方无法减少需支付的进化费用。","inherited":"-","security":"","image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1743643745797ST20-07.png","officialId":6473,"form":"成长期","attribute":"疫苗种","types":"昆虫型/大冒险","originalModel":"ST20-07","cnProductCode":"ST-20","variants":[{"model":"ST20-07","productCode":"ST-20","officialId":6473,"image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1743643745797ST20-07.png"},{"model":"ST20-07_WT","productCode":"宣传卡","officialId":6692,"image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1744682593466ST20-07_WT.png"}]},"ST20-08":{"name":"比多兽","effect":"〔进化〕拥有“大冒险”特征的Lv.3：费用2\n\n【进化时】若我方场上存在的驯兽师不多于1张，则可以从我方的手牌中，不支付费用登场1张拥有“大冒险”特征的驯兽师卡牌。","inherited":"《贯通》（当此数码宝贝进行攻击的战斗中对方数码宝贝被消灭时，在攻击结束前进行判定）","security":"","image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1743643745797ST20-08.png","officialId":6474,"form":"成熟期","attribute":"疫苗种","types":"昆虫型/大冒险","originalModel":"ST20-08","cnProductCode":"ST-20","variants":[{"model":"ST20-08","productCode":"ST-20","officialId":6474,"image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1743643745797ST20-08.png"},{"model":"ST20-08_WT","productCode":"宣传卡","officialId":6693,"image":"https://source.windoent.com/dtcg/Picture/1744682593466ST20-08_WT.png"}]},"ST20-09":{"name":"超比多兽","effect":"〔进化〕拥有“大冒险”特征的Lv.4：费用3\n\n【登场时】【进化时】将我方的1只数码宝贝转换为活跃状态。此后，我方拥有“大冒险”特征的驯兽师每有2种颜色，将对方的1只数码宝贝转换为休息状态。\